{
  "book": "alma",
  "bookName": "Alma",
  "chapter": 56,
  "voice": {
    "provider": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "ddDFRErfhdc2asyySOG5",
    "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
    "settings": {
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.75,
      "style": 0.35,
      "use_speaker_boost": true
    },
    "name": "Samuel"
  },
  "pauses": {
    "line_ms": 180,
    "verse_ms": 500
  },
  "duration": 795.064,
  "lines": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 8.638,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now it came to pass in the commencement of the thirtieth year of the reign of the judges, on the second day in the first month,",
      "verse": "56:1",
      "lineIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 8.818,
      "end": 11.558,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Moroni received an epistle from Helaman,",
      "verse": "56:1",
      "lineIndex": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 11.738,
      "end": 15.221,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "stating the affairs of the people in that quarter of the land.",
      "verse": "56:1",
      "lineIndex": 3
    },
    {
      "start": 15.901,
      "end": 18.362,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And these are the words which he wrote, saying:",
      "verse": "56:2",
      "lineIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 18.542,
      "end": 20.771,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "My dearly beloved brother, Moroni,",
      "verse": "56:2",
      "lineIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 20.951,
      "end": 24.573,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "as well in the Lord as in the tribulations of our warfare;",
      "verse": "56:2",
      "lineIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 24.753,
      "end": 26.564,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "behold, my beloved brother,",
      "verse": "56:2",
      "lineIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 26.744,
      "end": 31.434,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I have somewhat to tell you concerning our warfare in this part of the land.",
      "verse": "56:2",
      "lineIndex": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 32.114,
      "end": 34.808,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, two thousand of the sons of those men",
      "verse": "56:3",
      "lineIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "start": 34.988,
      "end": 38.61,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "whom Ammon brought down out of the land of Nephi\u2014",
      "verse": "56:3",
      "lineIndex": 10
    },
    {
      "start": 38.79,
      "end": 42.087,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "now ye have known that these were descendants of Laman,",
      "verse": "56:3",
      "lineIndex": 11
    },
    {
      "start": 42.267,
      "end": 45.286,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "who was the eldest son of our father Lehi;",
      "verse": "56:3",
      "lineIndex": 12
    },
    {
      "start": 45.966,
      "end": 50.749,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now I need not rehearse unto you concerning their traditions or their unbelief,",
      "verse": "56:4",
      "lineIndex": 13
    },
    {
      "start": 50.929,
      "end": 53.762,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for thou knowest concerning all these things\u2014",
      "verse": "56:4",
      "lineIndex": 14
    },
    {
      "start": 54.442,
      "end": 56.671,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Therefore it sufficeth me that I tell you",
      "verse": "56:5",
      "lineIndex": 15
    },
    {
      "start": 56.851,
      "end": 60.891,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that two thousand of these young men have taken their weapons of war,",
      "verse": "56:5",
      "lineIndex": 16
    },
    {
      "start": 61.071,
      "end": 63.3,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and would that I should be their leader;",
      "verse": "56:5",
      "lineIndex": 17
    },
    {
      "start": 63.48,
      "end": 66.684,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and we have come forth to defend our country.",
      "verse": "56:5",
      "lineIndex": 18
    },
    {
      "start": 67.364,
      "end": 71.915,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now ye also know concerning the covenant which their fathers made,",
      "verse": "56:6",
      "lineIndex": 19
    },
    {
      "start": 72.095,
      "end": 77.621,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they would not take up their weapons of war against their brethren to shed blood.",
      "verse": "56:6",
      "lineIndex": 20
    },
    {
      "start": 78.301,
      "end": 80.344,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But in the twenty and sixth year,",
      "verse": "56:7",
      "lineIndex": 21
    },
    {
      "start": 80.524,
      "end": 88.233,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "when they saw our afflictions and our tribulations for them, they were about to break the covenant which they had made",
      "verse": "56:7",
      "lineIndex": 22
    },
    {
      "start": 88.413,
      "end": 91.339,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and take up their weapons of war in our defence.",
      "verse": "56:7",
      "lineIndex": 23
    },
    {
      "start": 92.019,
      "end": 97.081,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But I would not suffer them that they should break this covenant which they had made,",
      "verse": "56:8",
      "lineIndex": 24
    },
    {
      "start": 97.261,
      "end": 99.676,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "supposing that God would strengthen us,",
      "verse": "56:8",
      "lineIndex": 25
    },
    {
      "start": 99.856,
      "end": 106.125,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "insomuch that we should not suffer more because of the fulfilling the oath which they had taken.",
      "verse": "56:8",
      "lineIndex": 26
    },
    {
      "start": 106.805,
      "end": 110.288,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But behold, here is one thing in which we may have great joy.",
      "verse": "56:9",
      "lineIndex": 27
    },
    {
      "start": 110.468,
      "end": 113.115,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For behold, in the twenty and sixth year,",
      "verse": "56:9",
      "lineIndex": 28
    },
    {
      "start": 113.295,
      "end": 120.633,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I, Helaman, did march at the head of these two thousand young men to the city of Judea, to assist Antipus,",
      "verse": "56:9",
      "lineIndex": 29
    },
    {
      "start": 120.813,
      "end": 125.596,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "whom ye had appointed a leader over the people of that part of the land.",
      "verse": "56:9",
      "lineIndex": 30
    },
    {
      "start": 126.276,
      "end": 128.97,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I did join my two thousand sons,",
      "verse": "56:10",
      "lineIndex": 32
    },
    {
      "start": 129.15,
      "end": 133.748,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "(for they are worthy to be called sons) to the army of Antipus,",
      "verse": "56:10",
      "lineIndex": 33
    },
    {
      "start": 133.928,
      "end": 137.225,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "in which strength Antipus did rejoice exceedingly;",
      "verse": "56:10",
      "lineIndex": 34
    },
    {
      "start": 137.405,
      "end": 140.749,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for behold, his army had been reduced by the Lamanites",
      "verse": "56:10",
      "lineIndex": 35
    },
    {
      "start": 140.929,
      "end": 142.508,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "because their forces",
      "verse": "56:10",
      "lineIndex": 36
    },
    {
      "start": 142.688,
      "end": 145.242,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "had slain a vast number of our men,",
      "verse": "56:10",
      "lineIndex": 37
    },
    {
      "start": 145.422,
      "end": 148.023,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for which cause we have to mourn.",
      "verse": "56:10",
      "lineIndex": 38
    },
    {
      "start": 148.703,
      "end": 151.954,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Nevertheless, we may console ourselves in this point,",
      "verse": "56:11",
      "lineIndex": 39
    },
    {
      "start": 152.134,
      "end": 155.896,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they have died in the cause of their country and of their God,",
      "verse": "56:11",
      "lineIndex": 40
    },
    {
      "start": 156.076,
      "end": 157.609,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, and they are happy.",
      "verse": "56:11",
      "lineIndex": 41
    },
    {
      "start": 158.289,
      "end": 161.633,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the Lamanites had also retained many prisoners,",
      "verse": "56:12",
      "lineIndex": 42
    },
    {
      "start": 161.813,
      "end": 164.135,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "all of whom are chief captains,",
      "verse": "56:12",
      "lineIndex": 43
    },
    {
      "start": 164.315,
      "end": 166.869,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for none other have they spared alive.",
      "verse": "56:12",
      "lineIndex": 44
    },
    {
      "start": 167.049,
      "end": 171.786,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And we suppose that they are now at this time in the land of Nephi;",
      "verse": "56:12",
      "lineIndex": 45
    },
    {
      "start": 171.966,
      "end": 174.056,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "it is so if they are not slain.",
      "verse": "56:12",
      "lineIndex": 46
    },
    {
      "start": 174.736,
      "end": 182.724,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now these are the cities of which the Lamanites have obtained possession by the shedding of the blood of so many of our valiant men:",
      "verse": "56:13",
      "lineIndex": 47
    },
    {
      "start": 183.404,
      "end": 186.051,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "The land of Manti, or the city of Manti,",
      "verse": "56:14",
      "lineIndex": 48
    },
    {
      "start": 186.231,
      "end": 191.432,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the city of Zeezrom, and the city of Cumeni, and the city of Antiparah.",
      "verse": "56:14",
      "lineIndex": 49
    },
    {
      "start": 192.112,
      "end": 193.97,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And these are the cities",
      "verse": "56:15",
      "lineIndex": 50
    },
    {
      "start": 194.15,
      "end": 197.633,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which they possessed when I arrived at the city of Judea;",
      "verse": "56:15",
      "lineIndex": 51
    },
    {
      "start": 197.813,
      "end": 200.878,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I found Antipus and his men toiling",
      "verse": "56:15",
      "lineIndex": 52
    },
    {
      "start": 201.058,
      "end": 203.659,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "with their might to fortify the city.",
      "verse": "56:15",
      "lineIndex": 53
    },
    {
      "start": 204.339,
      "end": 208.333,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, and they were depressed in body as well as in spirit,",
      "verse": "56:16",
      "lineIndex": 55
    },
    {
      "start": 208.513,
      "end": 213.575,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for they had fought valiantly by day and toiled by night to maintain their cities;",
      "verse": "56:16",
      "lineIndex": 56
    },
    {
      "start": 213.755,
      "end": 217.377,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and thus they had suffered great afflictions of every kind.",
      "verse": "56:16",
      "lineIndex": 57
    },
    {
      "start": 218.057,
      "end": 221.447,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now they were determined to conquer in this place or die;",
      "verse": "56:17",
      "lineIndex": 58
    },
    {
      "start": 221.627,
      "end": 226.689,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore you may well suppose that this little force which I brought with me,",
      "verse": "56:17",
      "lineIndex": 59
    },
    {
      "start": 226.869,
      "end": 228.587,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, those sons of mine,",
      "verse": "56:17",
      "lineIndex": 60
    },
    {
      "start": 228.767,
      "end": 231.182,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "gave them great hopes and much joy.",
      "verse": "56:17",
      "lineIndex": 61
    },
    {
      "start": 231.862,
      "end": 239.153,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now it came to pass that when the Lamanites saw that Antipus had received a greater strength to his army,",
      "verse": "56:18",
      "lineIndex": 62
    },
    {
      "start": 239.333,
      "end": 245.881,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they were compelled by the orders of Ammoron to not come against the city of Judea, or against us, to battle.",
      "verse": "56:18",
      "lineIndex": 63
    },
    {
      "start": 246.561,
      "end": 248.604,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And thus were we favored of the Lord;",
      "verse": "56:19",
      "lineIndex": 64
    },
    {
      "start": 248.784,
      "end": 252.174,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for had they come upon us in this our weakness",
      "verse": "56:19",
      "lineIndex": 65
    },
    {
      "start": 252.354,
      "end": 255.512,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they might have perhaps destroyed our little army;",
      "verse": "56:19",
      "lineIndex": 66
    },
    {
      "start": 255.692,
      "end": 257.503,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but thus were we preserved.",
      "verse": "56:19",
      "lineIndex": 67
    },
    {
      "start": 258.183,
      "end": 262.873,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "They were commanded by Ammoron to maintain those cities which they had taken.",
      "verse": "56:20",
      "lineIndex": 68
    },
    {
      "start": 263.053,
      "end": 265.607,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And thus ended the twenty and sixth year.",
      "verse": "56:20",
      "lineIndex": 69
    },
    {
      "start": 265.787,
      "end": 268.945,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And in the commencement of the twenty and seventh year",
      "verse": "56:20",
      "lineIndex": 70
    },
    {
      "start": 269.125,
      "end": 272.329,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "we had prepared our city and ourselves for defence.",
      "verse": "56:20",
      "lineIndex": 71
    },
    {
      "start": 273.009,
      "end": 276.864,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now we were desirous that the Lamanites should come upon us;",
      "verse": "56:21",
      "lineIndex": 72
    },
    {
      "start": 277.044,
      "end": 281.874,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for we were not desirous to make an attack upon them in their strongholds.",
      "verse": "56:21",
      "lineIndex": 73
    },
    {
      "start": 282.554,
      "end": 288.87,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that we kept spies out round about, to watch the movements of the Lamanites,",
      "verse": "56:22",
      "lineIndex": 74
    },
    {
      "start": 289.05,
      "end": 296.62,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they might not pass us by night nor by day to make an attack upon our other cities which were on the northward.",
      "verse": "56:22",
      "lineIndex": 75
    },
    {
      "start": 297.3,
      "end": 302.037,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For we knew in those cities they were not sufficiently strong to meet them;",
      "verse": "56:23",
      "lineIndex": 76
    },
    {
      "start": 302.217,
      "end": 310.855,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore we were desirous, if they should pass by us, to fall upon them in their rear, and thus bring them up in the rear",
      "verse": "56:23",
      "lineIndex": 77
    },
    {
      "start": 311.035,
      "end": 313.543,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "at the same time they were met in the front.",
      "verse": "56:23",
      "lineIndex": 78
    },
    {
      "start": 313.723,
      "end": 316.463,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "We supposed that we could overpower them;",
      "verse": "56:23",
      "lineIndex": 79
    },
    {
      "start": 316.643,
      "end": 319.847,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but behold, we were disappointed in this our desire.",
      "verse": "56:23",
      "lineIndex": 80
    },
    {
      "start": 320.527,
      "end": 323.499,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "They durst not pass by us with their whole army,",
      "verse": "56:24",
      "lineIndex": 81
    },
    {
      "start": 323.679,
      "end": 325.815,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "neither durst they with a part,",
      "verse": "56:24",
      "lineIndex": 82
    },
    {
      "start": 325.995,
      "end": 329.85,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "lest they should not be sufficiently strong and they should fall.",
      "verse": "56:24",
      "lineIndex": 83
    },
    {
      "start": 330.53,
      "end": 334.385,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Neither durst they march down against the city of Zarahemla;",
      "verse": "56:25",
      "lineIndex": 84
    },
    {
      "start": 334.565,
      "end": 339.209,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "neither durst they cross the head of Sidon, over to the city of Nephihah.",
      "verse": "56:25",
      "lineIndex": 85
    },
    {
      "start": 339.889,
      "end": 345.183,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And thus, with their forces, they were determined to maintain those cities which they had taken.",
      "verse": "56:26",
      "lineIndex": 86
    },
    {
      "start": 345.863,
      "end": 349.021,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now it came to pass in the second month of this year,",
      "verse": "56:27",
      "lineIndex": 87
    },
    {
      "start": 349.201,
      "end": 354.774,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "there was brought unto us many provisions from the fathers of those my two thousand sons.",
      "verse": "56:27",
      "lineIndex": 88
    },
    {
      "start": 355.454,
      "end": 360.795,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And also there were sent two thousand men unto us from the land of Zarahemla.",
      "verse": "56:28",
      "lineIndex": 90
    },
    {
      "start": 360.975,
      "end": 363.901,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And thus we were prepared with ten thousand men,",
      "verse": "56:28",
      "lineIndex": 91
    },
    {
      "start": 364.081,
      "end": 368.307,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and provisions for them, and also for their wives and their children.",
      "verse": "56:28",
      "lineIndex": 92
    },
    {
      "start": 368.987,
      "end": 372.934,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the Lamanites, thus seeing our forces increase daily,",
      "verse": "56:29",
      "lineIndex": 93
    },
    {
      "start": 373.114,
      "end": 375.761,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and provisions arrive for our support,",
      "verse": "56:29",
      "lineIndex": 94
    },
    {
      "start": 375.941,
      "end": 379.285,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they began to be fearful, and began to sally forth,",
      "verse": "56:29",
      "lineIndex": 95
    },
    {
      "start": 379.465,
      "end": 384.388,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "if it were possible to put an end to our receiving provisions and strength.",
      "verse": "56:29",
      "lineIndex": 96
    },
    {
      "start": 385.068,
      "end": 393.984,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now when we saw that the Lamanites began to grow uneasy on this wise, we were desirous to bring a stratagem into effect upon them;",
      "verse": "56:30",
      "lineIndex": 97
    },
    {
      "start": 394.164,
      "end": 400.48,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore Antipus ordered that I should march forth with my little sons to a neighboring city,",
      "verse": "56:30",
      "lineIndex": 98
    },
    {
      "start": 400.66,
      "end": 404.004,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "as if we were carrying provisions to a neighboring city.",
      "verse": "56:30",
      "lineIndex": 99
    },
    {
      "start": 404.684,
      "end": 407.981,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And we were to march near the city of Antiparah,",
      "verse": "56:31",
      "lineIndex": 101
    },
    {
      "start": 408.161,
      "end": 412.712,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "as if we were going to the city beyond, in the borders by the seashore.",
      "verse": "56:31",
      "lineIndex": 102
    },
    {
      "start": 413.392,
      "end": 419.29,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that we did march forth, as if with our provisions, to go to that city.",
      "verse": "56:32",
      "lineIndex": 103
    },
    {
      "start": 419.97,
      "end": 427.122,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that Antipus did march forth with a part of his army, leaving the remainder to maintain the city.",
      "verse": "56:33",
      "lineIndex": 104
    },
    {
      "start": 427.302,
      "end": 430.367,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But he did not march forth until I had gone forth",
      "verse": "56:33",
      "lineIndex": 105
    },
    {
      "start": 430.547,
      "end": 433.844,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "with my little army, and came near the city Antiparah.",
      "verse": "56:33",
      "lineIndex": 106
    },
    {
      "start": 434.524,
      "end": 437.635,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, in the city Antiparah were stationed",
      "verse": "56:34",
      "lineIndex": 107
    },
    {
      "start": 437.815,
      "end": 439.951,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the strongest army of the Lamanites;",
      "verse": "56:34",
      "lineIndex": 108
    },
    {
      "start": 440.131,
      "end": 441.71,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, the most numerous.",
      "verse": "56:34",
      "lineIndex": 109
    },
    {
      "start": 442.39,
      "end": 450.563,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that when they had been informed by their spies, they came forth with their army and marched against us.",
      "verse": "56:35",
      "lineIndex": 110
    },
    {
      "start": 451.243,
      "end": 455.005,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that we did flee before them, northward.",
      "verse": "56:36",
      "lineIndex": 111
    },
    {
      "start": 455.185,
      "end": 459.365,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And thus we did lead away the most powerful army of the Lamanites;",
      "verse": "56:36",
      "lineIndex": 112
    },
    {
      "start": 460.045,
      "end": 462.413,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, even to a considerable distance,",
      "verse": "56:37",
      "lineIndex": 113
    },
    {
      "start": 462.593,
      "end": 470.906,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "insomuch that when they saw the army of Antipus pursuing them, with their might, they did not turn to the right nor to the left,",
      "verse": "56:37",
      "lineIndex": 114
    },
    {
      "start": 471.086,
      "end": 474.569,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but pursued their march in a straight course after us;",
      "verse": "56:37",
      "lineIndex": 115
    },
    {
      "start": 474.749,
      "end": 478.743,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and, as we suppose, it was their intent to slay us",
      "verse": "56:37",
      "lineIndex": 116
    },
    {
      "start": 478.923,
      "end": 481.384,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "before Antipus should overtake them,",
      "verse": "56:37",
      "lineIndex": 117
    },
    {
      "start": 481.564,
      "end": 485.14,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and this that they might not be surrounded by our people.",
      "verse": "56:37",
      "lineIndex": 118
    },
    {
      "start": 485.82,
      "end": 490.185,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now Antipus, beholding our danger, did speed the march of his army.",
      "verse": "56:38",
      "lineIndex": 119
    },
    {
      "start": 490.365,
      "end": 492.13,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But behold, it was night;",
      "verse": "56:38",
      "lineIndex": 120
    },
    {
      "start": 492.31,
      "end": 494.539,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore they did not overtake us,",
      "verse": "56:38",
      "lineIndex": 121
    },
    {
      "start": 494.719,
      "end": 496.995,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "neither did Antipus overtake them;",
      "verse": "56:38",
      "lineIndex": 122
    },
    {
      "start": 497.175,
      "end": 499.543,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore we did camp for the night.",
      "verse": "56:38",
      "lineIndex": 123
    },
    {
      "start": 500.223,
      "end": 503.752,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that before the dawn of the morning,",
      "verse": "56:39",
      "lineIndex": 124
    },
    {
      "start": 503.932,
      "end": 506.254,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "behold, the Lamanites were pursuing us.",
      "verse": "56:39",
      "lineIndex": 125
    },
    {
      "start": 506.434,
      "end": 509.917,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now we were not sufficiently strong to contend with them;",
      "verse": "56:39",
      "lineIndex": 126
    },
    {
      "start": 510.097,
      "end": 514.787,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, I would not suffer that my little sons should fall into their hands;",
      "verse": "56:39",
      "lineIndex": 127
    },
    {
      "start": 514.967,
      "end": 517.289,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore we did continue our march,",
      "verse": "56:39",
      "lineIndex": 128
    },
    {
      "start": 517.469,
      "end": 519.884,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and we took our march into the wilderness.",
      "verse": "56:39",
      "lineIndex": 129
    },
    {
      "start": 520.564,
      "end": 523.025,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now they durst not turn to the right",
      "verse": "56:40",
      "lineIndex": 130
    },
    {
      "start": 523.205,
      "end": 526.177,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "nor to the left lest they should be surrounded;",
      "verse": "56:40",
      "lineIndex": 131
    },
    {
      "start": 526.357,
      "end": 528.911,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "neither would I turn to the right",
      "verse": "56:40",
      "lineIndex": 132
    },
    {
      "start": 529.091,
      "end": 532.063,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "nor to the left lest they should overtake me,",
      "verse": "56:40",
      "lineIndex": 133
    },
    {
      "start": 532.243,
      "end": 535.819,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and we could not stand against them, but be slain,",
      "verse": "56:40",
      "lineIndex": 134
    },
    {
      "start": 535.999,
      "end": 537.996,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they would make their escape;",
      "verse": "56:40",
      "lineIndex": 135
    },
    {
      "start": 538.176,
      "end": 541.427,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and thus we did flee all that day into the wilderness,",
      "verse": "56:40",
      "lineIndex": 136
    },
    {
      "start": 541.607,
      "end": 543.372,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "even until it was dark.",
      "verse": "56:40",
      "lineIndex": 137
    },
    {
      "start": 544.052,
      "end": 548.603,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that again, when the light of the morning came",
      "verse": "56:41",
      "lineIndex": 138
    },
    {
      "start": 548.783,
      "end": 550.873,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "we saw the Lamanites upon us,",
      "verse": "56:41",
      "lineIndex": 139
    },
    {
      "start": 551.053,
      "end": 552.771,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and we did flee before them.",
      "verse": "56:41",
      "lineIndex": 140
    },
    {
      "start": 553.451,
      "end": 557.956,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But it came to pass that they did not pursue us far before they halted;",
      "verse": "56:42",
      "lineIndex": 141
    },
    {
      "start": 558.136,
      "end": 562.408,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and it was in the morning of the third day of the seventh month.",
      "verse": "56:42",
      "lineIndex": 142
    },
    {
      "start": 563.088,
      "end": 567.407,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, whether they were overtaken by Antipus we knew not,",
      "verse": "56:43",
      "lineIndex": 143
    },
    {
      "start": 567.587,
      "end": 569.259,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but I said unto my men:",
      "verse": "56:43",
      "lineIndex": 144
    },
    {
      "start": 569.439,
      "end": 571.715,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, we know not but they have halted",
      "verse": "56:43",
      "lineIndex": 145
    },
    {
      "start": 571.895,
      "end": 574.728,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for the purpose that we should come against them,",
      "verse": "56:43",
      "lineIndex": 146
    },
    {
      "start": 574.908,
      "end": 577.23,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they might catch us in their snare;",
      "verse": "56:43",
      "lineIndex": 147
    },
    {
      "start": 577.91,
      "end": 580.232,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Therefore what say ye, my sons,",
      "verse": "56:44",
      "lineIndex": 148
    },
    {
      "start": 580.412,
      "end": 582.966,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "will ye go against them to battle?",
      "verse": "56:44",
      "lineIndex": 149
    },
    {
      "start": 583.646,
      "end": 586.711,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now I say unto you, my beloved brother Moroni,",
      "verse": "56:45",
      "lineIndex": 150
    },
    {
      "start": 586.891,
      "end": 591.628,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that never had I seen so great courage, nay, not amongst all the Nephites.",
      "verse": "56:45",
      "lineIndex": 151
    },
    {
      "start": 592.308,
      "end": 594.862,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For as I had ever called them my sons",
      "verse": "56:46",
      "lineIndex": 152
    },
    {
      "start": 595.042,
      "end": 599.222,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "(for they were all of them very young) even so they said unto me:",
      "verse": "56:46",
      "lineIndex": 153
    },
    {
      "start": 599.402,
      "end": 601.724,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Father, behold our God is with us,",
      "verse": "56:46",
      "lineIndex": 154
    },
    {
      "start": 601.904,
      "end": 604.783,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he will not suffer that we should fall;",
      "verse": "56:46",
      "lineIndex": 155
    },
    {
      "start": 604.963,
      "end": 606.449,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "then let us go forth;",
      "verse": "56:46",
      "lineIndex": 156
    },
    {
      "start": 606.629,
      "end": 609.973,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "we would not slay our brethren if they would let us alone;",
      "verse": "56:46",
      "lineIndex": 157
    },
    {
      "start": 610.153,
      "end": 615.029,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore let us go, lest they should overpower the army of Antipus.",
      "verse": "56:46",
      "lineIndex": 158
    },
    {
      "start": 615.709,
      "end": 619.192,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now they never had fought, yet they did not fear death;",
      "verse": "56:47",
      "lineIndex": 159
    },
    {
      "start": 619.372,
      "end": 622.669,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they did think more upon the liberty of their fathers",
      "verse": "56:47",
      "lineIndex": 160
    },
    {
      "start": 622.849,
      "end": 625.032,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "than they did upon their lives;",
      "verse": "56:47",
      "lineIndex": 161
    },
    {
      "start": 625.212,
      "end": 630.46,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, they had been taught by their mothers, that if they did not doubt, God would deliver them.",
      "verse": "56:47",
      "lineIndex": 162
    },
    {
      "start": 631.14,
      "end": 635.087,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And they rehearsed unto me the words of their mothers, saying:",
      "verse": "56:48",
      "lineIndex": 164
    },
    {
      "start": 635.267,
      "end": 637.543,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "We do not doubt our mothers knew it.",
      "verse": "56:48",
      "lineIndex": 165
    },
    {
      "start": 638.223,
      "end": 641.799,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that I did return with my two thousand",
      "verse": "56:49",
      "lineIndex": 166
    },
    {
      "start": 641.979,
      "end": 644.301,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "against these Lamanites who had pursued us.",
      "verse": "56:49",
      "lineIndex": 167
    },
    {
      "start": 644.481,
      "end": 648.15,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now behold, the armies of Antipus had overtaken them,",
      "verse": "56:49",
      "lineIndex": 168
    },
    {
      "start": 648.33,
      "end": 650.791,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and a terrible battle had commenced.",
      "verse": "56:49",
      "lineIndex": 169
    },
    {
      "start": 651.471,
      "end": 656.904,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "The army of Antipus being weary, because of their long march in so short a space of time,",
      "verse": "56:50",
      "lineIndex": 170
    },
    {
      "start": 657.084,
      "end": 660.103,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "were about to fall into the hands of the Lamanites;",
      "verse": "56:50",
      "lineIndex": 171
    },
    {
      "start": 660.283,
      "end": 663.023,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and had I not returned with my two thousand",
      "verse": "56:50",
      "lineIndex": 172
    },
    {
      "start": 663.203,
      "end": 665.757,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they would have obtained their purpose.",
      "verse": "56:50",
      "lineIndex": 173
    },
    {
      "start": 666.437,
      "end": 668.945,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For Antipus had fallen by the sword,",
      "verse": "56:51",
      "lineIndex": 174
    },
    {
      "start": 669.125,
      "end": 672.422,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and many of his leaders, because of their weariness,",
      "verse": "56:51",
      "lineIndex": 175
    },
    {
      "start": 672.602,
      "end": 675.528,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which was occasioned by the speed of their march\u2014",
      "verse": "56:51",
      "lineIndex": 176
    },
    {
      "start": 675.708,
      "end": 680.584,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore the men of Antipus, being confused because of the fall of their leaders,",
      "verse": "56:51",
      "lineIndex": 177
    },
    {
      "start": 680.764,
      "end": 683.365,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "began to give way before the Lamanites.",
      "verse": "56:51",
      "lineIndex": 178
    },
    {
      "start": 684.045,
      "end": 687.296,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that the Lamanites took courage,",
      "verse": "56:52",
      "lineIndex": 179
    },
    {
      "start": 687.476,
      "end": 689.334,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and began to pursue them;",
      "verse": "56:52",
      "lineIndex": 180
    },
    {
      "start": 689.514,
      "end": 693.322,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and thus were the Lamanites pursuing them with great vigor",
      "verse": "56:52",
      "lineIndex": 181
    },
    {
      "start": 693.502,
      "end": 696.799,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "when Helaman came upon their rear with his two thousand,",
      "verse": "56:52",
      "lineIndex": 182
    },
    {
      "start": 696.979,
      "end": 699.347,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and began to slay them exceedingly,",
      "verse": "56:52",
      "lineIndex": 183
    },
    {
      "start": 699.527,
      "end": 704.96,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "insomuch that the whole army of the Lamanites halted and turned upon Helaman.",
      "verse": "56:52",
      "lineIndex": 184
    },
    {
      "start": 705.64,
      "end": 710.284,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now when the people of Antipus saw that the Lamanites had turned them about,",
      "verse": "56:53",
      "lineIndex": 185
    },
    {
      "start": 710.464,
      "end": 714.969,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they gathered together their men and came again upon the rear of the Lamanites.",
      "verse": "56:53",
      "lineIndex": 186
    },
    {
      "start": 715.649,
      "end": 719.178,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now it came to pass that we, the people of Nephi,",
      "verse": "56:54",
      "lineIndex": 187
    },
    {
      "start": 719.358,
      "end": 725.674,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the people of Antipus, and I with my two thousand, did surround the Lamanites, and did slay them;",
      "verse": "56:54",
      "lineIndex": 188
    },
    {
      "start": 725.854,
      "end": 732.913,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, insomuch that they were compelled to deliver up their weapons of war and also themselves as prisoners of war.",
      "verse": "56:54",
      "lineIndex": 189
    },
    {
      "start": 733.593,
      "end": 737.912,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now it came to pass that when they had surrendered themselves up unto us,",
      "verse": "56:55",
      "lineIndex": 190
    },
    {
      "start": 738.092,
      "end": 741.714,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "behold, I numbered those young men who had fought with me,",
      "verse": "56:55",
      "lineIndex": 191
    },
    {
      "start": 741.894,
      "end": 744.495,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "fearing lest there were many of them slain.",
      "verse": "56:55",
      "lineIndex": 192
    },
    {
      "start": 745.175,
      "end": 750.516,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But behold, to my great joy, there had not one soul of them fallen to the earth;",
      "verse": "56:56",
      "lineIndex": 193
    },
    {
      "start": 750.696,
      "end": 754.179,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, and they had fought as if with the strength of God;",
      "verse": "56:56",
      "lineIndex": 194
    },
    {
      "start": 754.359,
      "end": 759.142,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, never were men known to have fought with such miraculous strength;",
      "verse": "56:56",
      "lineIndex": 195
    },
    {
      "start": 759.322,
      "end": 762.666,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and with such mighty power did they fall upon the Lamanites,",
      "verse": "56:56",
      "lineIndex": 196
    },
    {
      "start": 762.846,
      "end": 764.657,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they did frighten them;",
      "verse": "56:56",
      "lineIndex": 197
    },
    {
      "start": 764.837,
      "end": 770.038,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and for this cause did the Lamanites deliver themselves up as prisoners of war.",
      "verse": "56:56",
      "lineIndex": 198
    },
    {
      "start": 770.718,
      "end": 773.458,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And as we had no place for our prisoners,",
      "verse": "56:57",
      "lineIndex": 199
    },
    {
      "start": 773.638,
      "end": 778.886,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that we could guard them to keep them from the armies of the Lamanites,",
      "verse": "56:57",
      "lineIndex": 200
    },
    {
      "start": 779.066,
      "end": 782.131,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore we sent them to the land of Zarahemla,",
      "verse": "56:57",
      "lineIndex": 201
    },
    {
      "start": 782.311,
      "end": 786.723,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and a part of those men who were not slain of Antipus, with them;",
      "verse": "56:57",
      "lineIndex": 202
    },
    {
      "start": 786.903,
      "end": 788.668,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the remainder I took",
      "verse": "56:57",
      "lineIndex": 203
    },
    {
      "start": 788.848,
      "end": 791.263,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and joined them to my stripling Ammonites,",
      "verse": "56:57",
      "lineIndex": 204
    },
    {
      "start": 791.443,
      "end": 794.415,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and took our march back to the city of Judea.",
      "verse": "56:57",
      "lineIndex": 205
    }
  ]
}